---
description: >-
  State diagram composite-container colouring under the handDrawn look (roughjs
  shapes, not rects — a separate style codepath from the classic look): three
  concurrency regions (NumLock/CapsLock/ScrollLock) in one composite state.
  Rendered under the "redux-color" theme.
config:
  theme: redux-color
  look: handDrawn
